From 83c405f7230da273581b28060a274a627f1672bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Truong Huy Hoa <huyhoa308@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:03:13 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(dog): re-enable the 4 servo legs for the final
 wiring

FL 7, FR 4, RL 6, RR 5, same direction on every leg, 500-2500 us like the
bench test; FR is a continuous-rotation servo and is never driven. Emotions
and states drive leg motions again (wiggle, wave, crouch, sit, quick stand,
soft wiggle while speaking, sit after 60 s idle). Comments updated for the
WeAct I2S Speaker V1 module.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
